# Files whose public copy differs from the private one, and must never be blind-copied.
# Checked by scripts/check-redactions.sh before every push.
#
# A `cp` from the private repo overwrote the redacted THREAT-MODEL.md once already. The
# sync rule says "copy files across"; it did not say which files carry edits that a copy
# destroys. This list does.
facilitator/THREAT-MODEL.md
contracts/GO-NO-GO.md
docs/registry-format.md
